    <name>Anaerobic (50min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 10min from 45% to 56% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 56% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 40% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 48% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 56% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 64% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 72% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 80% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 88% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 96% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 104% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 112% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 120% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 128% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 136% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 144% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 150% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 150% FTP | Cooldown: 15min from 56% to 40% FTP</description>
